HMG Hospital - Comprehensive EMR with Billing System

Overview

This is a full-featured Hospital Management System built with Python and Tkinter, designed for use in Nigerian healthcare settings (with NGN currency support). It combines Electronic Medical Records (EMR) with integrated billing, laboratory management, pharmacy, radiology, and AI-powered clinical decision support—all in a single desktop application.

---

Key Features

🏥 Patient Management

· Patient Registration with unique ID generation
· Global Patient Context - once a patient is selected, they remain active across all modules (EMR, Billing, Pharmacy, etc.)
· Patient Search with live filtering
· Patient Results Gallery - upload/capture images, documents, and lab reports

📋 Electronic Medical Records (EMR)

Complete multi-department EMR with department-specific forms:

Department Key Features
General Medicine Vital signs, comprehensive history, physical/systemic exam, diagnosis, treatment plan
Pediatrics Growth parameters, birth/feeding history, immunization tracking, developmental milestones
Obstetrics Gestational age, parity, gravida, fetal monitoring, LMP/EDD
Gynecology Menstrual history, obstetric history, pelvic examination
Surgery Pre-op assessment, ASA grade, operation details, post-op plan, consent forms
Cardiology Cardiac risk factors, heart sounds, ECG/Echo integration
Emergency Triage (Red/Orange/Yellow/Green), NEWS score, GCS, disposition tracking

🧠 AI Clinical Decision Support

· NEWS (National Early Warning Score) - automatically calculated from vitals with risk stratification
· AI Patient Summary - generates comprehensive clinical summaries from EMR, labs, radiology, and prescriptions
· Clinical Recommendations - AI suggests next steps based on abnormal results
· Machine Learning Data Extraction - structured data export for ML model training
· Risk Scoring - combines age, NEWS, diagnoses, and visit history

💰 Integrated Billing System

· Dynamic Bill Generation - add items from procedures, investigations, drugs, or custom charges
· Auto-Billing - automatically bill prescriptions and investigations
· Patient Bill Tracking - view, edit, and manage patient bills
· Inventory Deduction - drug stock automatically decreases when billed
· Currency Support - Nigerian Naira (₦) with proper formatting

💊 Pharmacy Module

· Drug Inventory Management - track stock levels, min stock alerts
· Prescription Dispensing - add drugs to prescription cart with instructions
· Stock Level Monitoring - automatic warnings for low/out-of-stock items
· Inventory Logging - track all stock changes with timestamps and user

🔬 Laboratory Module

· Test Ordering - select from comprehensive test catalog (FBC, Malaria, HbA1c, etc.)
· Results Entry - manual result input with reference ranges
· Instrument Integration - send tests to connected instruments (urine analyzer, etc.)
· Auto-Reception - instrument results appear automatically in EMR

📊 Radiology Module

· Study Request - X-ray, Ultrasound, CT, MRI, ECG
· Report Writing - findings, impression, and radiologist sign-off
· Completed Reports - view historical reports

📅 Appointments Module

· Book Appointments - date, time, doctor, department, reason
· Status Tracking - Scheduled → Arrived → Completed → Cancelled
· Today's View - quick view of today's appointments
· Filtering - filter by date

📈 Reports & Analytics

· Financial Reports - revenue by category, top bills, time periods
· Patient Statistics - demographics, blood group distribution, age groups
· Drug Inventory Reports - stock status, expiring drugs, value
· Department Performance - revenue and transaction analysis
· Export to Excel - all reports exportable to .xlsx
· Print Reports - HTML preview for printing

🖼️ Patient Results Module

· Camera Integration - capture photos directly from webcam (OpenCV)
· Gallery Upload - select images from device
· File Upload - support for PDFs, Word docs, text files
· Result Metadata - store result type, description, timestamp
· View & Delete - manage stored results

🔌 Laboratory Instrument Interface

· Simulated Instrument Connection - urine analyzer, hematology analyzer, chemistry analyzer
· Request Queue - send test requests to instruments
