· Real-time UI Updates - results appear immediately in lab tab
· Extensible - add new instruments easily

🛠️ Admin & System Management

· Data Backup - create/restore backups (ZIP format)
· Export All Data - full system export to Excel
· Data Reset - reset all system data
· System Settings - hospital name, currency, backup directory
