Technical Architecture

Technology Stack

· Python 3.x - core language
· Tkinter - GUI framework (native desktop)
· PIL/Pillow - image handling (camera/gallery)
· OpenCV - camera integration (optional)
· Pandas - reporting and Excel export
· JSON - data persistence (no database server required)
· Threading - background instrument processing

Data Storage

· All data stored as JSON files:
  · patients.json - patient registry
  · bills.json - billing records
  · emr.json - electronic medical records
  · drugs.json - drug inventory
  · lab_tests.json - laboratory records
  · appointments.json - appointments
  · procedures.json, investigations.json, other_charges.json
  · ml_training_data.json - machine learning training data
  · patient_results/ - captured images and documents

Design Patterns

· Global Patient Context - single source of truth for active patient
· Observer Pattern - UI updates when data changes
· Background Threading - non-blocking instrument processing
· Modular Tab Structure - each module independent but integrated

