System Workflow

Patient Journey

1. Register → patient gets unique ID
2. Select Patient → becomes active across all modules
3. Consultation → EMR entry in appropriate department
4. Order Tests → Lab tests ordered (can be sent to instruments)
5. Receive Results → Auto-received from instruments or manually entered
6. Dispense Drugs → Pharmacy dispenses from inventory
7. Generate Bill → Auto-bill from prescriptions and investigations
8. AI Summary → Clinical summary with recommendations

Instrument Workflow

1. Add Instrument → configure in Lab Instruments tab
2. Select Test → choose from lab test catalog
3. Send to Instrument → test enters request queue
4. Background Processing → instrument simulates analysis (2-5 sec)
5. Auto-Result → result appears in lab results
6. Optional Billing → user prompted to add to bill

